&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;fda438c7-b780-4639-815f-15ee357b1f30&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building cleanrooms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing factory infrastructure for aerospace or equivalent industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experience using AutoCAD or equivalent software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience programming and operating digital Building Management Systems (BMS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience implementing a new CMMS.&lt;/li&gt;
