&lt;p&gt;Pre-sales and post-sales network architecture and planning, which at its core involves optimizing high throughput satellite networks by understanding and trading dozens of parameters, including but not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital payload configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orbital slot selection and frequency planning&lt;/li&gt;
