&lt;li&gt;Gateway location(s) selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User terminal selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking / modem equipment selection and configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role provides a balance of technical and business / customer facing responsibilities, and is high visibility and high impact. This role includes 1:1 mentorship from a senior, seasoned sales engineer, enabling rapid learning and growth!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to optimize systems by juggling many variables, considering all options, running a detailed trade study&lt;/li&gt;
