&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and deconflict efforts with the Astranis USG team where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep expertise in how foreign governments and militaries procure satcom and secure communications — budget cycles, procurement law, offsets, and decision-making structures — and apply it to capture strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build senior relationships with defense/government stakeholders, attachés, primes, and channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel internationally and extensively to support business development, negotiations, and customer relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Network Planning, finance, operations, legal, and USG teams to develop strategic pursuits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pricing, deal structuring, and negotiation for sovereign/defense capacity and service agreements&lt;/li&gt;
