&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Astranis builds advanced satellites for high orbits, expanding humanity’s reach into the solar system. Today, Astranis satellites provide dedicated, secure networks to highly-sophisticated customers across the globe— large enterprises, sovereign governments, and the US military. With five satellites on orbit and many more set to launch soon, the company is servicing a backlog of more than $1 billion of commercial contracts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Astranis is the preferred satellite communications partner for buyers with stringent requirements for uptime, data security, network visibility, and customization. Astranis has raised over $750 million from some of the world’s best investors, from Andreessen Horowitz to Blackrock and Fidelity, and employs a team of 450 engineers and entrepreneurs. Astranis designs, builds, and operates its satellites out of its 153,000 sq. ft. headquarters in Northern California, USA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Motion Designer &amp;amp; Editor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Motion Editor to help tell our stories through world-class video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for crafting compelling films, product videos, customer stories, social media content, sales materials, and executive presentations that communicate complex technology with clarity and emotion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is more than an editing role. You&#39;ll shape how Astranis looks, feels, and moves across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead post-production for Astranis videos, including marketing, product, commercial, recruiting, and corporate communications videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create polished motion graphics and animations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable motion systems, templates, transitions, and graphic packages that strengthen the Astranis brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with creatives, engineers, marketers, and leadership to translate complex technical concepts into clear visual stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to creative development from concept through final delivery, helping shape narratives, pacing, and visual direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage color correction, sound mixing, finishing, and delivery across a variety of formats and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish and evolve Astranis&#39; visual storytelling standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
