&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Astranis builds advanced satellites for high orbits, expanding humanity’s reach into the solar system. Today, Astranis satellites provide dedicated, secure networks to highly-sophisticated customers across the globe— large enterprises, sovereign governments, and the US military. With five satellites on orbit and many more set to launch soon, the company is servicing a backlog of more than $1 billion of commercial contracts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Astranis is the preferred satellite communications partner for buyers with stringent requirements for uptime, data security, network visibility, and customization. Astranis has raised over $750 million from some of the world’s best investors, from Andreessen Horowitz to Blackrock and Fidelity, and employs a team of 450 engineers and entrepreneurs. Astranis designs, builds, and operates its satellites out of its 153,000 sq. ft. headquarters in Northern California, USA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Supply Chain Manager - Software &amp;amp; Indirect&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Supply Chain Manager is responsible for leading the company&#39;s software procurement and indirect sourcing activities, developing strategic supplier relationships, and implementing efficient sourcing strategies that optimize cost, compliance, and operational performance across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;SupplyChainManagerSoftware&amp;amp;Indirect-Role&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2f5806c3-9d9d-4486-a942-21ec9fa9cac1&quot;&gt;Manage the full lifecycle of software procurement, from requirements gathering and vendor evaluation through contract negotiation, renewal, and ongoing vendor management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;4f5fa836-ba92-4497-acf8-c941ac7932cf&quot;&gt;Partner with Engineering, IT, Security, Finance, Legal, and Operations teams to develop software sourcing strategies, evaluate technology solutions, analyze licensing models, and optimize cost, functionality, and vendor performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2330f8c5-15c3-4cb9-9df4-499261fa7276&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary owner for indirect procurement activities with a strong emphasis on enterprise software, SaaS applications, cloud services, and technology subscriptions, while supporting other indirect spend categories including equipment, employee benefits, and professional services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;364116b6-2284-4c6f-b376-a9d7f4e48b92&quot;&gt;Analyze software and indirect spend, evaluate supplier performance, identify consolidation opportunities, optimize software licensing, and develop sourcing alternatives that maximize value and reduce total cost of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;e314ac49-a097-4427-bd12-8123ba2460b3&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end RFI, RFP, and RFQ process for software and strategic indirect purchases, ensuring commercial terms are negotiated and appropriately documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;dcab0df8-8209-4f96-8fa1-9beda84852f0&quot;&gt;Lead negotiations for NDAs, Statements of Work (SOWs), Master Service Agreements (MSAs), software licensing agreements, and other commercial contracts before business is initiated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;eb8efb9f-cb29-4329-bebd-a83a04c98c3d&quot;&gt;Evaluate suppliers based on commercial, technical, security, compliance, and operational criteria, providing recommendations that balance business requirements, cost, and long-term value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6499ddb6-617f-4fe5-9b8d-bd040fe53f59&quot;&gt;Develop and execute category strategies for software procurement, including SaaS, cloud services, enterprise applications, and other technology categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;cf0ebc0e-8472-46ce-bdf8-1bfdc32b48d8&quot;&gt;Monitor software market trends, emerging technologies, licensing models, vendor roadmaps, and pricing to proactively identify opportunities, risks, and cost optimization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;3b49f1f4-649f-4bb5-bf78-ab3198f6e2ba&quot;&gt;Develop sourcing and negotiation strategies that achieve business objectives while building strong, long-term partnerships with strategic software vendors and service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1bfba264-5ef0-4d18-8c5f-52aba8c72da9&quot;&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to manage software renewals, license compliance, contract obligations, and supplier performance throughout the vendor lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;SupplyChainManagerSoftware&amp;amp;Indirect-Requirements&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;44894d8d-196a-457b-a09b-f47606cb3595&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Business, Supply Chain, Information Systems, or a related discipline (or comparable experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;06367e10-5c53-49ee-b49d-11e0daf2d183&quot;&gt;Minimum of 3+ years of professional experience in software procurement, strategic sourcing, indirect procurement, vendor management, or related supply chain disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6990d6be-40fb-483b-857e-4f49d537d5d4&quot;&gt;Experience negotiating software licensing agreements, SaaS subscriptions, cloud services, and commercial technology contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;435d697e-e7be-4b47-852e-5ffed5ccaa42&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience evaluating spend data, software utilization, licensing models, and supplier performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;af12df99-e0e6-4109-b2bc-f250082a67a2&quot;&gt;Incredibly detail-oriented—the type of person who thrives on managing multiple contracts, renewals, and vendor relationships while maintaining exceptional organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;94df6c4f-3b84-425f-bf7e-8b8c1604efd0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to collaborate effectively across Engineering, IT, Security, Finance, Legal, and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;SupplyChainManagerSoftware&amp;amp;Indirect-Bonus&quot;&gt;Bonus&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6b414ed9-f650-4b79-b03b-79b892619f10&quot;&gt;Experience managing enterprise software procurement in a high-growth technology or manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;4fefc4c2-40be-4506-9fa8-df78a932a998&quot;&gt;Familiarity with software asset management (SAM), SaaS management platforms, ERP systems, or procurement platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b05f0d18-ca17-44de-9500-7e0474a345af&quot;&gt;Experience negotiating cloud service agreements with major software vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;4b616d79-4979-4da0-994a-e687a6069548&quot;&gt;Knowledge of software licensing models, subscription management, and vendor risk or compliance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;58ce14fd-4997-4f8f-a9e1-88c8ba7c5c7a&quot;&gt;Experience supporting procurement in both software and broader indirect spend categories.&lt;/li&gt;
