&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMS Terms of Service&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. When you opt in to receive SMS messages from&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;replaceTag 183_companyName138&quot;&gt;Astranis Space Technologies Corp.&lt;/span&gt;, we may send you messages related to your job application, including updates, interview coordination, and other recruiting communications.&lt;br&gt;2. You can cancel the SMS service at any time by replying with any of the following industry standard keywords:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;a. STOP&lt;br&gt;b. STOPALL&lt;br&gt;c. OPTOUT&lt;br&gt;d. CANCEL&lt;br&gt;e. END&lt;br&gt;f. QUIT&lt;br&gt;g. UNSUBSCRIBE&lt;br&gt;h. REVOKE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;3. After you opt out, we may send one final text message confirming that you have been unsubscribed. No further recruiting SMS messages will be sent unless you opt in again.&lt;br&gt;4. To opt back in, reply with any of the following industry standard keywords:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;a. START&lt;br&gt;b. UNSTOP&lt;br&gt;c. YES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0;&quot;&gt;5. For help, reply HELP or contact us at EMAIL or PHONE NUMBER.&lt;br&gt;6. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.&lt;br&gt;7. Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency may vary. Contact your wireless provider for details.&lt;br&gt;8. For more information on how we handle your data, please review our Privacy Policy at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;replaceTag 183_privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;https://www.astranis.com/legal/privacy&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Astranis builds advanced satellites for high orbits, expanding humanity’s reach into the solar system. Today, Astranis satellites provide dedicated, secure networks to highly-sophisticated customers across the globe— large enterprises, sovereign governments, and the US military. With five satellites on orbit and many more set to launch soon, the company is servicing a backlog of more than $1 billion of commercial contracts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Astranis is the preferred satellite communications partner for buyers with stringent requirements for uptime, data security, network visibility, and customization. Astranis has raised over $750 million from some of the world’s best investors, from Andreessen Horowitz to Blackrock and Fidelity, and employs a team of 450 engineers and entrepreneurs. Astranis designs, builds, and operates its satellites out of its 153,000 sq. ft. headquarters in Northern California, USA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Trade and Regulatory Compliance Manager&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a results-driven Trade &amp;amp; Regulatory Compliance Manager to join our legal department and oversee our trade, ethics, and regulatory compliance programs. This role is anchored in U.S. export controls (ITAR and EAR), but also expands into broader corporate regulatory management. You will partner closely with engineering, supply chain, HR, and commercial sales teams to build scalable compliance frameworks that mitigate legal risk while driving operational growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the strategy, daily administration, and continuous enhancement of the company’s trade and regulatory compliance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert across key regulatory domains, including ITAR, EAR, OFAC sanctions, Foreign Corrupt Practices Act (FCPA), and FAR/DFARS provisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Classify complex technical data, hardware, software, and defense services against the Commerce Control List (CCL) and United States Munitions List (USML)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging business initiatives and foreign engagements to determine regulatory requirements; prepare and manage export authorizations, licenses, or agreements as operational needs arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, submit, and administer filings through government portals (including DECCS and SNAP-R) as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across engineering, supply chain, HR, and commercial sales teams to manage foreign national access, establish Technology Control Plans (TCPs), and review vendor/partner agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory compliance aspects of U.S. Government business, including ethics program alignment, mandatory disclosures, and foreign ownership/influence considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internal compliance reviews and risk audits; draft voluntary self-disclosures or regulatory filings as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver company-wide training on export controls, anti-bribery, trade compliance, and corporate ethics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track changes in federal laws and trade policies to update internal standards and operational procedures accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in business, international relations, legal studies, logistics, engineering, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of hands-on regulatory compliance experience, with core expertise in U.S. export controls (ITAR/EAR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of OFAC sanctions, FCPA anti-corruption standards, and USG contracting compliance rules (FAR/DFARS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with U.S. government filing systems, such as DECCS and SNAP-R&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate complex regulatory requirements into clear, actionable guidance for technical and business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills with meticulous attention to detail and a high sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize, manage multiple compliance projects, and solve problems independently in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified U.S. Export Compliance Officer (CUSECO) or other recognized trade compliance certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in the aerospace, defense, satellite, or advanced hardware manufacturing industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of U.S. Government (USG) contracting compliance, FAR/DFARS requirements, or CFIUS regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain a U.S. federal security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;All our positions offer a compensation package that includes equity and robust benefits.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Base pay is just one component of Astranis’s total rewards package. Your compensation also includes a significant equity package via incentive stock options, high-quality company-subsidized healthcare, disability and life insurance, 401(k) retirement planning, flexible PTO, and free on-site catered meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Astranis pay ranges are informed and defined through professional-grade salary surveys and compensation data sources. The actual base salary offered to a successful candidate will additionally be influenced by a variety of factors including experience, credentials &amp;amp; certifications, educational attainment, skill level requirements, and the level and scope of the position.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$115,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$235,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Citizenship, Lawful Permanent Residency, or Refugee/Asylee Status Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;(To comply with U.S. Government space technology export regulations, applicant must be a U.S. citizen, lawful permanent resident of the United States, or other protected individual as defined by 8 U.S.C. 1324b(a)(3))&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our mission and products are built for everyone, regardless of gender, race, creed, or background. We believe in a diverse and inclusive workplace, and we invite all people to join our team and bring their unique perspectives to make us stronger.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
